  "behavior": "It mainly patrols laboratory-related areas and can attack at both close and long range. When it has space, it uses energy blasts to pressure the target without needing to approach.",
  "interactionWithPlayer": "It can be more annoying than similar robots because of its ranged attacks. Even while the player is busy with melee enemies, SAUC.R can continue attacking from a safer position.",
  "interactionWithCreatures": "It can appear in areas containing other hostile robots, complementing melee enemies by maintaining ranged pressure while they close in on the target.",
  "strategy": "Prefer Sour damage, followed by Salty, and avoid Stabbing or Slashing weapons. If it appears alongside other robots, it can be worth prioritizing SAUC.R to remove ranged pressure first and then deal with the melee enemies. Keep moving to avoid its blasts while closing the distance.",
